            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention discloses a print head (104) for additive manufacturing. The print head may include at least two proximate hobs (103) configured to receive and pass therebetween a print material filament (110) for the additive manufacturing; a motor (602) configured to impart a rotation to at least one of the two hobs (103), wherein the passing results from the rotation; an eccentric force element (502) comprising at least a spring and a cam configured to exert force on one of the two hobs (103) to urge the dynamic force-receiving hob toward the other of the two hobs (103); and a threaded element (704) configured to enable manual adjustment to the eccentric force element (502).</p>
            </abstract>
